cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Collagen Reflectance Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  Desktop app for measuring the structure of collagen hydrogels in confocal reflectance images
  (fiber density, pore size, fiber thickness and length, alignment, patchiness), comparing gels
  before and after alternating-magnetic-field treatment with sham controls, gel-level statistics,
  registered local change maps, quality checks and Bayesian experiment planning.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Pisarev
    given-names: Sviatoslav
    affiliation: "Department of Chemistry, Hunter College, City University of New York (Matsui Lab)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SviatoslavPisarev/CollagenAnalyzer"
keywords:
  - collagen
  - confocal reflectance microscopy
  - extracellular matrix
  - fiber alignment
  - magnetic nanoparticles
  - image analysis
